Default barrel geometry
The closed/open voxel references were authored by the project owner and compiled
into complete four-state models. Packed and projected-native UV variants retain
the same geometry. They replace the older extrusion carrier; no donor chest
geometry or animation rig is included.

Default barrel trim
The barrel material pattern was authored by the project owner. Its directional
shading uses the Create: Skyweave palette and face-local trim boundaries;
Spectral's chest-frame design is not the source of this barrel pattern.
